      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5bb671964fe53149c4a6496c|full_name}: Interesting; I was told on the Discord that the lower limit is 0.03, and when I try a near clipping plane below that in my own world, it does not appear to work (ref camera is set up, yes). I think the clip plane is clamped at runtime, not buildtime, so setting up a script that freezes the near clip plane wouldn't really work. But I'd have to look into that.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
